b9265c9e6a428ca33bb34b0f10b0d0d140c7ebc8
read: seven Sol train rounds (defensive framing after round 1's filter cut) over the merged three-lane head; round 6 SHIP at 6f382fa16, round 7 SHIP at b9265c9e6a428ca33bb34b0f10b0d0d140c7ebc8 (P5 lift-flush bound; rehome orphan LOW owed). Luna reads per lane (promote luna-1/luna-final/luna-cure/luna-p5; reopen luna1; debt luna-1). Controller crossing reads of promote boot and the act gate. Live probe P1-P6 + CONTROL on a staged hearth. Owed rows recorded in batch3-after-q.md.

<<~/ahu>>

